repository-code: https://github.com/CodeZx6/BiST-IF
url: https://codezx6.github.io/papers/bist-if.html
abstract: BiST-IF predicts origin–destination (OD) flows between metro stations or urban areas by correcting delayed recent
  OD matrices, applying bi-directional origin/destination attention, and fusing arrival-side (Out-OD) flows through an attention-based
  mutual information mechanism. It lowers MAE by an average of 7.55% on HZMetro relative to the best baseline.
keywords:
- Origin–destination flow prediction
- Spatio-temporal data
- Bi-directional attention mechanism
- Traffic prediction
- Intelligent transport systems
- OD delay correction
- Out-OD flow
- Mutual information mechanism
